  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l as the image encoder (config_022) outperforms resnet50, and concat fusion (config_016) is better than weighted fusion. However, all prior experiments used singleprofile and no aggregation. This experiment tests the same high-performing image encoder and concat fusion with multiprofile and avgpool aggregation, clarifying whether aggregation methods and profile settings significantly impact performance. It balances exploitation of strong image encoder choices with exploration of critical design decisions (aggregation, profile setting) that remain untested."  
}

